      "The kid who nominates a pair of fancy rats falls somewhere between the kid who keeps it in a wire cage and the kid who keeps it in a wooden hutch in vote count order.",
      "The kid who nominates a leopard gecko falls somewhere between the kid who keeps it in a felt-lined shoebox and Sanjay in vote count order.",
